                                "sense_id": "b00a720d-bd1b-35e6-81ae-7c5479457efd",
                                "text": "A note of caution to readers with pets: Xylitol is toxic to dogs and can have potentially life-threatening effects. As owners of two doggos ourselves, we encourage anyone with a dog to use extreme caution when bringing xylitol into your home."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
